  "subject": "chore: bump version to v1.0.2110",
  "body": "Signed-off-by: Zach Aller <zach_aller@intuit.com>\n",
  "references": [
    {
      "commit": {
        "author": "\"Zach Aller\" <code@example.com>",
        "date": "2026-10-08T15:12:04-06:00",
        "subject": "fix(commitstatus): dedupe woken ChangeTransferPolicies by namespace and name (#2356)",
        "body": "CommitStatus gating is cross-namespace on purpose: a CommitStatus can gate\npolicies in any namespace, and triggerReconcileChangeTransferPolicy lists\npolicies on the SHA cluster-wide to wake them. The merge of those lists,\nUpsertChangeTransferPolicy, keyed on name only, so two namespaces promoting\nthe same repository with a same-named PromotionStrategy produced same-named\npolicies that collapsed to one entry, and the other was never woken.\n\nKey the merge on namespace and name. The lookups stay cluster-wide.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BmNNrkL768qXPQxYGu5Tz2\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "sha": "b100d5c74619dc20ca1bf7291ad455d61430a8ec",
        "repoUrl": "https://github.com/argoproj-labs/gitops-promoter"
      }
    }
  ]
}
